{"ID":"20240118145012-xbn115g","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145012-xbn115g","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145012-xbn115g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145012-rauu0or\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162017-a0ryhao\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162017-a0ryhao\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:123,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:123\u0026#125;","title":"322梓白皮","type":"doc","updated":"20240204145014"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145012-rauu0or","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145012-rauu0or","updated":"20240122161949"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，无毒。治热，去三虫。花、叶，捣敷猪疮。饲猪，肥大三倍。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161951-i2gu0c6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161951-i2gu0c6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】生山区。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161953-3ewqnxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161953-3ewqnxk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161954-upmy50m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161954-upmy50m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】梓白皮能解热，杀虫，亦治反胃疮疥，梓实为排水利尿药，治浮肿有效。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161956-nlt4jig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161956-nlt4jig"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗目中疾，主吐逆胃反，小儿热疮，身头烦热，蚀疮，煎汤浴之，并捣敷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161957-jjmoofp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161957-jjmoofp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】煎汤洗小儿壮热，一切疮疥，皮肤搔痒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161959-rcesail","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161959-rcesail"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162000-nen7k17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162000-nen7k17"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】寒症忌用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162008-odyi0w8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162008-odyi0w8"}},{"ID":"20240122162005-k4gfm0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162005-k4gfm0y","updated":"20240204144947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"梓白皮，味苦，这个药张仲景用的是桑白，（桑梓），这个药梓树的皮，根的皮，那也是用，一般我们用得不多，都是解热，使用的范围不是很广，像里面眼睛的、眼睛的病啊，我们都用秦皮，我们会用到这些药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122162017-a0ryhao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162017-a0ryhao","updated":"20240204145014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"越到后来这个药，我们实际上真的这个我使用的，几乎都没在使用。你像这个石楠、黄环、这个溲疏、鼠李呀，药实根呐，栾花、蔓椒、都没有使用它，包括那个豚卵，这个麋脂，这些药。到第335页，马刀，334页那个那个蛤蟆，虾蟆哦，六畜毛蹄甲，一般来说我们都不会去使用它。"}]}]}